      `completed` IS A BOOLEAN, `price` IS A NUMBER, `owner of the land` IS A BOOLEAN, `home` IS A `Building facts`
      `scheme` IS A BOOLEAN, `homebuilder` IS A BOOLEAN, `div 2C` IS A BOOLEAN, `extended` IS A BOOLEAN
      `replacement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Grant transaction`
`the grant transaction from my answers` `kind` `in Tasmania` `commenced` `completes` `completed` `price` `owner of the land` `home` `scheme` `homebuilder` `div 2C` `extended` `replacement` MEANS
    `Grant transaction` WITH
        `kind`                                                                                       IS `kind`
