GIVETH A `Co-owner answer`
DECIDE `Must this owner join my grant application` IS
    IF `must join in the application (s 15)` `who the other owner is`
    THEN `yes: they must join in my application (s 15)`
    ELSE `no: they are excluded from s 15`

