      `the months the Commissioner allowed me to move in` IS A NUMBER @desc 12, unless the Commissioner approved a longer period to start living there
      `the months I must live there` IS A NUMBER @desc 6, unless the Commissioner approved a shorter period
      `the day it first became apparent I would not meet it` IS A DATE @desc The day it first became apparent that you would not meet the residence requirement in the time allowed (if it never did, give a day after the period ends)
GIVETH A `Grant repayment answer`
DECIDE `By when must I tell the Commissioner and repay my grant` IS
    `Grant repayment answer` WITH
        `I must tell the Commissioner in writing and repay the grant no later than` IS
            `the day that is` `the days to act after a failure of the residence requirement` `days after` (`the relevant date (s 20(3))` (`the end of the period allowed for compliance (s 20(3)(a))` `the completion date` `the months the Commissioner allowed me to move in` `the months I must live there`) `the day it first became apparent I would not meet it`)
        `the most I can be fined, in penalty units` IS `the most fine, in penalty units, for not acting after a failure under` `a first home owner grant paid in anticipation (FHOG Act ss 12, 20)`

@export My first home owner grant was paid before I met the residence requirement, and I sold or gave up my interest in the home: by what date must I tell the Commissioner and repay (First Home Owner Grant Act 2000 s 20(3A))?
